# EventType:  1213718009 (B0 isospin partner)
# Descriptor: [anti-B0 -> D+ eta l- nu] non-resonant cc
# NickName: B0_Dlnu_Deta_nonres
# Documentation: b->c l nu process, B0 mode, non-resonant D eta production by introducing a dummy
#   resonance. Isospin partner of decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/DummyDeta (D0 eta), generated by the
#   full-isospin generalization of the SEM/Hausdorff pipeline: charged dummy resonance decays to
#   D+ eta instead of D0 eta; same custom mass/width (2.55 GeV, 3.0 GeV).
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Cuts: None
# Date: 20260831
#

Alias Deta0sig D_0*+
Alias anti-Deta0sig D_0*-
ChargeConj Deta0sig anti-Deta0sig

# Set custom dummy particle properties (mass, width)
Particle Deta0sig        2.55      3.0
Particle anti-Deta0sig   2.55      3.0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500  Deta0sig     e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500  Deta0sig     mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

# Dummy resonance decays to produce non-resonant D eta
Decay Deta0sig
1.0   D+ eta     PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-Deta0sig

End
